# Pairs with AppRulesSystemOriginOnly. Only system origin may put an app-owned rule id.
MODULE: AppsRuleWriteSkipsOriginCheck
TARGET: AppRulesSystemOriginOnly
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the store admits an operator put of an app-owned rule id
PERTURBS: WriteAppRule

--- FIND
    LET admitted == sys
--- REPLACE
    LET admitted == TRUE
--- END
